{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261110/photo/bkn-20261110060036446-1110_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261110075220\"/><p>今日(10日)凌晨1時46分，執法人員於港島西區堅尼地城城西道設置路障截查車輛，並向駕駛人士進行隨機酒精呼氣測試。期間一名32歲尼泊爾籍電單車男司機酒精測試超標，涉嫌酒後駕駛被捕，經調查後他獲准保釋，須於11月下旬向執法部門報到。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T16:23:44.158199+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T22:00:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T16:17:11.353723+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T16:17:11.353723+00:00","content_hash":"a1462798289b13e1117d7f6a090000f0045f55de96eb3ac4ea578995647ced79","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}